    Bug 1956603 - Fetch messages EWS folders when requested. r=edicharry


    This patch changes some of the behaviour of our EWS implementation related to
    fetching messages. The existing implementation has a comment implying we should
    always search for new messages in all folders when the server's `GetNewMessages`
    method is called, but this does not seem to match the behaviour of other
    protocols, which seem to specifically sync the message list for the current
    folder.

    Additionally, this patch makes the folder the sole entity responsible for
    fetching its own messages - the current implementation made things a bit
    confusing by fetching on `UpdateFolder`, but pass `GetNewMessages` calls onto
    the server.

    I've left a couple ideas as TODOs for future improvements. I don't think they're
    as urgently needed as the core functionality of this patch, and would require
    quite a bit of a refactor to be properly implemented.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D247129

